| **H2** | `provisionTenantProduction` fail-closed | ⏳ |
| **H3** | `guard:workspace-certification` + proof matrix rows + drop-in spec | CI via `phase-10-guard` or dedicated workflow path |
| **H4 (optional)** | Super Admin badge + disabled prod create for stub | UX spec + smoke |

